WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.067
President Biden kicked off

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.135
his truncated visit

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.603
to Asia to meet with fellow world

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:05.705
leaders at the G7 summit in Japan.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.474
The leaders of some of the world's

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.042
largest economies are expected

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.077
to try to keep a sharp focus on China's

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.178
growing aggression

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:12.779
globally

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.581
and on Russia's brutal

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.516
war against Ukraine.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.350
But as President

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.118
Biden shakes hands

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:18.952
with fellow presidents

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.520
and prime ministers,

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.822
one American family is urging

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.257
President Biden to address

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.326
another issue close to their hearts.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:27.427
They're asking President Biden

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.295
to press harder

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.131
on Japan's Prime Minister

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:33.233
Fumio Kushida, to release

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.834
an American Navy lieutenant

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.537
who is in prison in Japan.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.671
Lieutenant, Original Kono

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:38.972
has been

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:39.572
behind bars

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:40.907
in Japan for nearly 300

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.909
days, part of his three year sentence

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.077
for what Japanese courts

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:44.677
called the, quote,

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:45.678
negligent driving

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.415
deaths of two Japanese citizens in May.

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:49.516
20, 21

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:50.850
Lieutenant O'Connor says he suffered

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.118
from acute mountain sickness

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:52.752
as he was driving

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:54.454
down from Mount Fuji with his family

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.489
and became unconscious behind the wheel.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.725
And that led to the tragic, deadly crash.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.192
Joining us now

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.126
for an exclusive interview from

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:01.761
Japan is his wife, Brittany,

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:02.262
our co-owners.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:03.596
Brittany, good to see you again.

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:05.698
Quickly, if you can remind our viewers

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.201
why you think this three year sentence

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:09.769
is unfair, and undeserved

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.141
What happened on May 29th?

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:18.745
2021 was absolutely a tragedy.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.849
However, he was mid-conversation

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:23.817
with my daughter

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:26.252
when he lost consciousness.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.854
He couldn't be awoken.

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:30.557
A crash happened back in and wake him.

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.959
He did not fall asleep.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:35.228
He was not negligent.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.863
And so

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.067
I understand what happened was a tragedy.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.802
He said from day one,

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.070
he wanted to make sure the family

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.705
was taken care of.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.040
But he has also maintained

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.341
that he was never tired

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:49.943
and he did not fall asleep.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.511
And there is no evidence to suggest

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.545
that he did.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:53.913
So your husband sent you a letter

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:54.614
a couple of weeks ago

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:55.348
that you've shared with us.

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:56.249
I want to read part of it.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:58.284
It says, I'm not doing that good.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:01:59.519
The walls and bars

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:01.654
seem to be making my cell even smaller.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.188
As of late.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.723
I get sick to my stomach

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.892
thinking about whether 30 minute meetings

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:07.060
through a window is helping

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.328
or hurting the kids. And you.

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:10.530
I feel closer to an animal

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.898
than a human being right now.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:12.932
Just just awful.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.767
Tell us about your reaction

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:15.502
when you read that, if

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:16.169
you would, Brittany

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.275
I was heartbroken.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:22.775
You know,

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.612
I've I've been with Reg for 12 years.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.916
He's really good at doing

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:32.252
really hard things, things

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:33.753
that people just don't want to do

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:36.089
without complaint, with a good attitude.

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:40.560
And and to hear his spirit

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.563
just kind of breaking

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:45.698
it.

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.433
It breaks my heart. And it also.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.269
It makes me mad.

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:49.936
Yeah.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.338
How are your kids

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:55.708
And, you know,

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:58.978
it depends on the day.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:00.914
But they're hurting,

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.282
you know, they

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:04.050
they try to make sense of this.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.719
We talk about it all the time.

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.254
But my son asked me the other day,

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:09.889
he said, Mommy, the president

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:10.957
you said the president's

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.492
getting daddy home.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:15.662
And why is me home yet?

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:17.096
And, you know, if

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.831
if daddy suffered an emergency

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:20.767
why is he in jail?

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:23.269
And those are questions I can't

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.971
I can't answer,

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:25.271
you know,

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:26.406
and my daughter says, Mommy,

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.708
I just want to hug daddy.

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.710
I can't do anything to fix that.

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:35.682
But they're good natured kids.

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:36.749
They're wonderful.

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:37.717
And, you know,

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.485
they're doing the best they can.

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:39.986
So you

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:41.221
you that's a reference, obviously,

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.322
to the brief discussion

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:43.289
you had with President Biden

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:44.224
after his State of the Union

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:45.458
speech in February.

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:46.893
He promised you

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:47.827
he wouldn't give up

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:49.095
and you have praised the White House

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:50.863
for engaging with you.

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.665
Is the Navy helping at all?

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.334
Is the Pentagon

00:03:55.835 --> 00:03:57.870
No, absolutely not.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.072
They've they've done nothing

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:01.074
but work against us.

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:01.674
In fact, he's

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:02.475
accused the Pentagon

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.811
of conducting a whisper campaign

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:05.678
in an attempt

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:07.113
to convince some people

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:08.281
that your husband, in fact,

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:10.016
got a fair trial in Japan.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:10.950
And you say that

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.385
you even have some emails

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:13.052
that would prove

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:13.453
Pentagon

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:14.787
officials are pushing this narrative

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.356
and they're lying.

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:16.823
But you're not going

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:18.091
to release those emails now.

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:19.125
Tell us more about this

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.162
You know, we have the

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:26.266
emails outlining the status

00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:28.134
of forces agreement violations

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:31.638
that were committed in the investigation.

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:33.973
Letters have been sent out

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:36.309
to members of Congress.

00:04:36.309 --> 00:04:37.410
We've gotten a hold of

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:38.378
some of those people,

00:04:38.378 --> 00:04:40.647
have given them to us and have said

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:42.582
hey, this is what DOD is saying.

00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:43.416
It's not quite in line

00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:44.350
with what you're saying.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.854
I've taken those letters into CNN Legal.

00:04:47.887 --> 00:04:49.088
Gone over them point

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:51.591
by pointing confirmed

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:55.128
with them that they are false.

00:04:55.561 --> 00:04:58.498
And yet these things continue to be said

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:01.367
And I just I do

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:02.302
I understand that

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:05.104
the alliance with Japan is important.

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:08.274
I do not believe that it is so weak

00:05:08.274 --> 00:05:10.076
that we need to allow Japan

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:13.646
to unjustly imprison our naval officers

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:16.082
for any actions.

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:17.784
Thank you so much.

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:18.985
Keep speaking out.

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:19.619
Keep talking.

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:20.553
And we're going to keep having you.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:20.753
We're going

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:22.322
to keep talking about this case.

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:23.323
We really appreciate your time.

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:26.459
Thank you, Jake.

